# Day 7 — Linux Redirection & Pipes 🔀🐧

## Topics Practiced

- `>` — Output redirection
- `>>` — Append output
- `<` — Input redirection
- `2>` — Error redirection
- `|` — Pipe
- stdout
- stderr
- Command chaining
- Output filtering

